<h2>Welcome, <?= htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['admin_name'] ?? 'Admin') ?></h2>
<p>An E-commerce system connects three main parties — Customers, Sellers, and the Platform itself (managed by Admin) — into a single marketplace. A Seller registers on the platform and creates a store, then lists Products under relevant Categories, specifying details such as price, description, and available stock. A Customer browses these Products, adds the ones they like to their Cart or Wishlist, and places an Order when ready to purchase. Each Order is then linked to Payment information (confirming how and when the customer paid) and Shipment details (tracking how the product is delivered from the seller to the customer)..</p>
